{"id":425,"name":"drifloon","speciesId":425,"dex":425,"form":"normal","generation":4,"types":["ghost","flying"],"stats":{"hp":90,"attack":50,"defense":34,"special-attack":60,"special-defense":44,"speed":70},"abilities":[{"name":"aftermath","hidden":false},{"name":"unburden","hidden":false},{"name":"flare-boost","hidden":true}],"height":4,"weight":12,"baseExp":70,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/425.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/425.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/425.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/425.ogg","genus":"Balloon Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon balão","flavor":[{"version":"diamond","text":"A Pokémon formed by the spirits of people and Pokémon. It loves damp, humid seasons."},{"version":"pearl","text":"It tugs on the hands of children to steal them away. However, it gets pulled around instead."},{"version":"platinum","text":"Because of the way it floats aimlessly, an old folktale calls it a “Signpost for Wandering Spirits.”"},{"version":"heartgold","text":"It is whispered that any child who mistakes DRIFLOON for a balloon and holds on to it could wind up missing."},{"version":"black-2","text":"These Pokémon are called the “Signpost for Wandering Spirits.” Children holding them sometimes vanish."},{"version":"sun","text":"Stories go that it grabs the hands of small children and drags them away to the afterlife. It dislikes heavy children."},{"version":"moon","text":"If for some reason its body bursts, its soul spills out with a screaming sound."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"Its round body is stuffed with souls and expands each time it leads someone away."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Wandering souls gathered together to form this Pokémon. When trying to make friends with children, Drifloon grabs them by the hand."},{"version":"sword","text":"Perhaps seeking company, it approaches children. However, it often quickly runs away again when the children play too roughly with it."},{"version":"shield","text":"The gathering of many souls gave rise to this Pokémon. During humid seasons, they seem to appear in abundance."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"Said to lure away young children and carry them off to the afterlife. Some whisper that Drifloon are formed of reincarnated human souls, but these rumors are as yet unconfirmed."}],"flavorPt":"Diz-se que atrai crianças pequenas e as leva para a vida após a morte. Alguns sussurram que os Drifloon são formados por almas humanas reencarnadas, mas esses rumores ainda não foram confirmados.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":125,"eggGroups":["indeterminate"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"drifloon","speciesId":425,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 28"],"species":"drifblim","speciesId":426,"evolvesTo":[]}]},"varieties":[{"id":425,"name":"drifloon","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/425.png"}],"games":[8,9,10,11,14,15,16,17,18,20,23,24,25],"moves":[{"id":15,"learn":[[8,"tm",0],[9,"tm",0],[10,"tm",0],[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[23,"tm",0]]},{"id":16,"learn":[[8,"lv",11],[9,"lv",11],[10,"lv",11],[11,"lv",11],[14,"lv",8],[15,"lv",8],[16,"lv",8],[17,"lv",8],[18,"lv",8],[20,"lv",4],[23,"lv",4],[25,"lv",4]]},{"id":19,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":20,"learn":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"id":34,"learn":[[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"tm",0],[23,"egg",0]]},{"id":50,"learn":[[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"id":60,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":85,"lea